[en.DECISION_C02_REPORT_FILTHY_RICH]
Publishing Filthy Rich’s Black Material

[en.DECISION_C02_REPORT_FILTHY_RICH_desc]
Through EEMO’s help, we have obtained black material of Filthy Rich: he received funds from multiple sources such as Las Pegasus, Manehattan, and Sire’s Hollow. He also bribed the Minister of Treasury of the Equestria Empire. If Filthy Rich runs for the next Duchess of Ponyville, the scandal of black money will be a great weapon to defeat him.

[zh.DECISION_C02_REPORT_FILTHY_RICH]
公布钱多多的黑料

[zh.DECISION_C02_REPORT_FILTHY_RICH_desc]
借助秩序部的帮助，我们得到了钱多多的黑料：钱多多从洛马基、马哈顿、名流谷等多个来源接收资金，并向小马利亚帝国财政部行贿。如果钱多多竞选小马谷下一任公爵，黑金丑闻将会是打败他的利器。
